@startuml

title PayLink - Payment State Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #EAF2F8
    BorderColor #34495E
    ArrowColor #34495E
    FontColor #2C3E50
}

[*] --> Initiated

' Initial validation
Initiated --> FundsHeld : Fraud checks pass\nand sufficient funds available
Initiated --> Rejected : Fraud check fails\nor insufficient funds

' Wallet hold and biller request
FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : Payment request sent

' Biller response
SentToBiller --> Completed : Biller confirms payment
SentToBiller --> Failed : Biller refuses payment
SentToBiller --> Unknown : Timeout (10 seconds)

' Resolve unknown payments
Unknown --> Completed : Biller later confirms
Unknown --> Failed : Biller refuses or\nreconciliation confirms no payment

' Refund failed payments
Failed --> Refunded : Held funds released\nto customer wallet

' Final states
Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Unknown
  Payment remains pending.
  Funds stay held.
  Never refund automatically
  while the result is unknown.
end note

note bottom of Completed
  Final state
end note

note bottom of Rejected
  Final state
end note

note bottom of Refunded
  Final state
end note

@enduml
